# The repository stores text with LF endings. Without this, a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the worktree copies to CRLF, and the
# generated ai/ prompts then carry stray \r characters that the committed
# source files do not have. The build reads whatever is on disk, so the
# mismatch reappears every time one of those files is touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets stay binary.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
